  "metadata": "Last modified on Oct 13, 2016",
  "content": "\n                    <div class=\"plugin-tabmeta-details\"><div class=\"table-wrap\"></div></div><h2 id=\"Step11.1.1:AddNon-RootSCMSComponent-Goals\">Goals</h2><p>Provide a process&nbsp;for adding an SCMS component other than root <abbr title=\"Certificate Authority\">CA</abbr>, e.g. intermediate CA, <abbr title=\"Pseudonym Certificate Authority\">PCA</abbr>, <abbr title=\"Registration Authority\">RA</abbr>, etc.</p><h2 id=\"Step11.1.1:AddNon-RootSCMSComponent-Assumptions\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Assumptions</span></h2><p>Use cases and more specific requirements are in the subsections under this heading.</p><h2 id=\"Step11.1.1:AddNon-RootSCMSComponent-Requirements\"></h2><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"Step11.1.1:AddNon-RootSCMSComponent-\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><div id=\"refresh-module--1657509553\" class=\"refresh-module-id jira-table\">\n<p>\n    \n        \n    \n        \n\n</p></div><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"></div></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                                                      \n                ",
